Vote: REQUEST_CHANGES

- `src/Web/ReactApp/src/features/printers/components/FailureDetectionMonitoringBadge.tsx:43-50` rewrites the reason for any `disabled` status when live `isPrinting === true`. `src/Web/ReactApp/src/features/printers/utils/failureDetectionStatus.ts:164-166` renders `status.reason` for non-monitoring states, so unsupported-backend printers lose their explanatory copy and incorrectly show the generic waiting message.
- The same regression exists in `src/Web/ReactApp/src/features/printers/components/FailureDetectionMonitoringOverlay.tsx:69-76`, so the overlay/modal path is affected too.
- `src/Web/ReactApp/src/test/features/printers/FailureDetectionMonitoringBadge.test.tsx:339-407` only covers stale `idle` and `monitoring` DTOs; there is no `disabled` unsupported-backend regression test to catch this.

